<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sē-cŭbo</span></b> , ŭi,
			1, v. n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To lie alone</i>, <i>sleep by one's
				self</i> or <i>without a bedfellow</i> (not in
			Cic.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of a man,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					61, 105</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 39, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 7, 8,
				2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 7 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of a woman,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 3, 26</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. Am. 3, 10, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. F. 2,
				328</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In gen., <i>to live alone</i> or <i>in solitude</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">miles depositis annosus secubat armis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 25</span></i>
			 (3, 20), 5; <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 123,
			31</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
